    "business_value": "Removes the engineering release from the product-tuning loop, which is the FR-13 no-code-change promise.",
    "description": "The Policy Editor over income, age, score, tenure and rate thresholds. Saving appends a new immutable policy version that becomes active in the running process, leaving the prior version byte-identical. Combined with the D6 submission-time pinning rule, an activation mid-flight never changes an in-flight application's basis.",
